{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"everforest-dark","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Everforest Dark","description":"A green and earthy dark theme that is comfortable to read.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Everforest Dark","path":"themes/everforest-dark.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/everforest-dark.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Everforest Dark\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#2d353b\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#d3c6aa\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#272e33\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#232a2e\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#232a2e\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#272e33\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#343f44\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#475258\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#343f44\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#272e33\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#232a2e\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#a7c080\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#a7c080\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#a7c080\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#475258\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#343f4480\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#a7c080\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#232a2e\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#e67e80\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#a7c080\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#dbbc7f\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#e67e80\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#859289\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a7c080\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d699b6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e67e80\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#dbbc7f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a7c080\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d699b6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7fbbb3\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e69875\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#dbbc7f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#83c092\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Everforest Dark\n\nA green and earthy dark theme that is comfortable to read.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Everforest Dark** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Everforest palette by sainnhe (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#2d353b` |\n| Text | `#d3c6aa` |\n| Accent | `#a7c080` |\n| Keywords | `#e67e80` |\n| Strings | `#a7c080` |\n| Functions | `#a7c080` |\n| Types | `#dbbc7f` |\n| Comments | `#859289` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}